        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk5-prepositions-p07-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "较 + comparison object + predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "较 with an explicit comparison object means compared with. Without that object, adverbial 较 merely qualifies the degree.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "今年较去年冷。",
                "pinyin": "jīnnián jiào qùnián lěng 。",
                "meaning": "This year is colder than last year.",
                "audio": "a29e47efbc7da99bd41bb4611cbbff3d309d3f129d4c18a003c9ad60b6f1a03f"
              },
              {
                "text": "这次较上次好。",
                "pinyin": "zhè cì jiào shàng cì hǎo 。",
                "meaning": "This time is better than last time.",
                "audio": "fbe8264884655426d0faffd3287c1d6be8399e7fd0b2ce70a34e88565870fe30"
              }
